---
pagination:
  data: locationIndex.regions
  size: 1
  alias: streek
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ streek.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Film locations in {{ streek.region }}"
  seo_title: "Film Locations in {{ streek.region }}, {{ streek.country }}: {{ streek.count }} Places to Shoot | Tubes"
  description: "{{ streek.count }} film and TV locations in {{ streek.region }}, {{ streek.inCountry }}: {{ streek.typesPhrase }}. Photos, practical details and a link to every location."
  excludeFromLlms: true
---
{#- Streekpagina: wat er in een regio of hoofdstad te draaien valt. Vanaf
    MIN_REGION locaties, anders is het een pagina met vier kaarten. De
    regionamen zijn gelijkgetrokken met scripts/normalize-regions.mjs. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/film-locations/">Film locations</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="{{ streek.countryUrl }}">{{ streek.country }}</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ streek.region }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="{{ streek.countryUrl }}">{{ streek.country }}</a></p>
      <h1>Film and TV locations in {{ streek.region }}</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ streek.count }} places to shoot in {{ streek.region }}, {{ streek.inCountry }}: {{ streek.typesPhrase }}.
        {{ streek.stats.photos }} have a photo and {{ streek.stats.practical }} carry practical details the location publishes itself.
      </p>
    </header>
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    {%- if streek.byType.length > 1 %}
    <h2>What is here</h2>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for t in streek.byType %}
      <li><a href="{{ t.url }}">{{ t.plural }} <span>{{ t.count }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}

    {% set lijst = streek.locations %}{% set toonLand = false %}{% set meerUrl = null %}
    {% include "partials/location-cards.njk" %}

    {%- if streek.incentive %}
    <h2>What {{ streek.inCountry }} pays back</h2>
    <p>
      {{ streek.inCountry | capitalize_first }} runs the {{ streek.incentive.scheme }}{% if streek.incentive.rate_label %}, worth {{ streek.incentive.rate_label }}{% endif %}. Work out the net value on your own spend in the <a href="/compare-film-incentives/">incentive comparison</a>.
    </p>
    {%- endif %}

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="{{ streek.countryUrl }}">All locations in {{ streek.inCountry }}</a> &middot;
      <a href="/film-locations/">All regions</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-film-tv-locations/">Search all {{ locationIndex.total }} locations</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Shooting in {{ streek.region }}?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so a location decision becomes a working budget instead of a guess.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
